2 CONT https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_Dauerer?wprov=sfla1
2 CONT
2 CONT Married in Stockholm on 03/03/1646 with pharmacist George Christian Daurer, born 06.12.1618 in Prague , † 1664-03-24 in Stockholm. He was paralyzed in 1661 and was bedridden until his death. Maria took over after the death of her 
2 CONC husband , his privileges and contained a pharmacy.
2 CONT
