2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 19 AUG 2002
2 ADDR
3 CITY Eugene Lane County Oregon, USA
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ='''Harold Clifford Svarverud'''=
2 CONT
2 CONT The graveside service and a memorial service for Harold Clifford Svarverud of Eugene who died August 19 of age related causes. He was 88.
2 CONT
2 CONT Svarverud was born August 21, 1913 in Eugene to Hans and Christina Strand Svarverud. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Ruth Mcbeth in Eugene on June 2, 1941. She died in 2000.
2 CONT
2 CONT He worked as a farmer and independent logger until his retirement in 1972.
2 CONT
2 CONT Svarverud played several musical instruments and enjoyed hunting, fishing, the ocean and music. A lifetime resident of Eugene, Svarverud was a charter member of Good Shepherd Lutheran Church in Eugene and belonged to Spencer creek
2 CONC  Grange.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include '''two daughters'''. '''Bernice Hayes''' and '''Betty Svarverud''', both of Eugene; six grandchildren; nine great grandchildren; and one great-great-grandchild.
2 CONT
2 CONT Visitation will be held from 9 a.m. to 10 a.m. Friday at Rest Haven Memorial Park. A memorial service will be at 11:30 a.m. Friday at Good Shepherd Lutheran Church in Eugene.
2 CONT Memorial contributions may be made to the memorial Fund at Good Shepherd Lutheran Church in Eugene
