2 CONT    2.  Jens SIDENIUS
2 CONT    3. +Berthe Maria SIDENIUS
2 CONT    4. +Christiana Sophia SIDENIUS
2 CONT    5. +Henning Christopher SIDENIUS
2 CONT    6. +Nicolina Elisabet SIDENIUS
2 CONT    7.  Anne Cathrine SIDENIUS
2 CONT    8. +Anne Cathrine SIDENIUS
2 CONT    9.  Bolette Helene SIDENIUS
2 CONT   10.  Jakob SIDENIUS 
2 CONT
