2 CONT
2 CONT     * MARRIAGE: 6 Jul 1758 
2 CONT
2 CONT    1. +Edvard SIDENIUS
2 CONT    2. +Jakob SIDENIUS
2 CONT    3.  Christian SIDENIUS
2 CONT    4.  Isak SIDENIUS
2 CONT    5. +Christian SIDENIUS
2 CONT    6.  Karen Marie SIDENIUS
