1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Christian Ernst Günther''' is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Christian-Ernst-G%C3%BCnther?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=blood&to=6000000019626077379 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 13th
