1 NAME Lt. Col. Carl Fromhold Tallberg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1676
2 ADDR
3 STAE Älvsborgs län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 JAN 1735
