1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ='''Ethel Svarverud (McCubbins)'''=
2 CONT
2 CONT Ethel Svarverud of 3358 Hawthorne, Eugene passed away June 17, 1984 at the age of 72. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born July 14, 1911 in Creswell and had been a lifelong resident of this vicinity. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married to Clarence H Svarverud in Eugene on November 12, 1933. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving besides her husband are 2 children, Carolyn E Stallings of Redmond and Vernon E Svarverud of Eugene; brother Attle Asher of Fall City, Oregon, 5 grandchildren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services will be held Thursday, June 21, 1984 at 11:30 a.m. in Poole Larsen Chapel. Concluding service to be held at Lane memorial Gardens. 
